9", "personaname": "reyjkl", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128603179/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 13638, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 262, "last_played": 1531528824, "avatar": "9cafae15e2da12b491c510a18151726d18c4905e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Love the lack of push to buy things from the store. However, there is still an element of \"pay to win\" (from what i've seen). I still highly recommend this game because the controls are not too hard to use (although there could be immprovement on the default layout like the sprint/crouch combo). Gameplay is fun, but I have yet to dabble into multiplayer. From what i've seen the story, characters, and sound is great. Overall, really surprised me and the graphics are surprisingly good and stable given the \"free to play\" nature of the game. However, I do have to say there is some noticable microstutters every now and then but it is still definitely enjoyable.", "timestamp_created": 1442961313, "timestamp_updated": 1442961313, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18151159", "author": {"steamid": "76561198212970307", "personaname": "brianb69692003", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198212970307/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1163, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 881, "last_played": 1455724527, "avatar": "90b04ee69adee1070ac650b96b719d725fd52465"}, "language": "english", "review": "For a FREE game, Warframe is by far the best game ive played. It's graphics are comperable to that of Skyrim. It's very fast paced, however you have the option to go at your own pace. The style of FPS in Warframe is pretty cool aswell. Overall 8 out of 10 for me. What would make it better is more in game credit shopping and less real money trades.", "timestamp_created": 1442956891, "timestamp_updated": 1442956891, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18150505", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067701671", "personaname": "Rib", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067701671/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 196887, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 46362, "last_played": 1655867155, "avatar": "68e03135447ea9aeaf942310973b75d200d5140c"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you liked ME3 online in the slightest, this is a much more advanced type of game with similar style. The thing that made me continue playing this game was constant updates. The developers are constantly fixing bugs and adding content. \n\n10/10 will continue to play past 1000 hours I'm sure\n\nedit: I played well past 1000 hours", "timestamp_created": 1442953481, "timestamp_updated": 1556817001, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}